Package: ludworks-browser
Version: ${VERSION}
Architecture: ${ARCH}
Maintainer: Ludworks <noreply@ludworks.app>
Section: web
Priority: optional
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libnss3, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libgbm1, libdrm2, libxss1, libxtst6, libsecret-1-0, xdg-utils
Provides: www-browser, gnome-www-browser, x-www-browser
Homepage: https://ludworks.app
Description: Ludworks Browser - Chromium with your Ludworks passwords and passkeys
 Fast Chromium-based web browser (castlabs Electron build with Widevine DRM)
 that signs in to your self-hosted Ludworks server and keeps passwords,
 passkeys, bookmarks, history, open tabs and settings in sync, end-to-end
 encrypted with your master password. Imports and exports Bitwarden vaults.
